segments.en:
Likutay Halachos — Yoreh Day'ah 1 — Signs of Kosher Animals and Wild Beasts, #1

body {

font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;

font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.85; color: #1a1a2e;

background: #fdfaf4; max-width: 860px;

margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 2.2rem 4rem;

p { text-align: justify; margin: 0.6em 0 1.1em; }

.book-title { text-align: center; font-size: 1.45em; font-weight: bold; color: #4a1942; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; }

.halacha-title { text-align: center; font-size: 1.25em; font-weight: bold; color: #4a1942; margin: 0.5em 0 0.1em; }

.subtitle { text-align: center; font-style: italic; font-size: 1.05em; color: #555; margin-bottom: 1.4em; }

.source-line { text-align: center; font-size: 0.95em; font-style: italic; color: #6b4c0e; background: #fef6e4; border-left: 4px solid #c8962a; padding: 0.5em 1em; margin: 1.2em auto; max-width: 700px; }

.section-num { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.13em; color: #7a3b00; display: block; margin: 1.6em 0 0.3em; }

.ht { font-style: italic; color: #2c5f8a; }

.kab { font-style: italic; color: #5a2d7a; }

.em { font-weight: bold; }

.src { font-size: 0.88em; color: #888; }

.verse { font-style: italic; color: #2c5a2c; }

.note { font-size: 0.92em; color: #555; }

details.heb { display: block; margin: 0.3em 0 0.8em; }

details.heb > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.78em; color: #888; border-bottom: 1px dashed #bbb; display: inline; }

details.heb > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

details.heb[open] > summary { color: #4a1942; }

.heb-text { display: block; direction: rtl; font-size: 1.05em; background: #f8f0ff; border: 1px solid #c9a0dc; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.7em 1em; margin: 0.6em 0; line-height: 1.9; color: #2d0045; }

.para-block { position: relative; }

.para-block:hover { background: #f5f0e8; border-radius: 4px; }

.summation { margin-top: 3em; padding: 1.2em 1.5em; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); color: #e0d7ff; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 6px solid #c8962a; }

.summation h3 { font-size: 1.15em; color: #f5c842; margin: 0 0 0.8em; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }

.summation ul { padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 0; }

.summation li { margin-bottom: 0.5em; line-height: 1.7; }

hr.divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #d4b896; margin: 2em 0; }

Likutay Halachos
